# docs/28 §3.5 (S1a): handed to the wrong Mac. The work Mac pulls two memos; in 设置 → 存储
# (Opt+M, then `,`) "再交一次" asks first (a box on 取消), then puts them back, never for that
# Mac; "给这台 Mac" would undo it; the home Mac takes them.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include work_mac.cpas
wait 600
include memo.cpas
include memo.cpas
pull
press opt+m
press ,
shot storage  设置 → 存储: 再交一次 ·XXXX 的 2 次, 给这台 Mac 没有, 清掉留底 2 段, the facts
press tab
shot storage-menu  Tab on 存储: its 本页 rows
press tab
press enter
shot again-box  Enter: 把 2 次再交给别的 Mac？ ·XXXX 不会再拿到, the cursor on 取消
press /
press enter
wait 300
shot again  / Enter: 已排回: 2 次录音; 待传 2, nothing kept; 给这台 Mac 2 段
pull
shot not-here  the work Mac pulls again: nothing (still 待传 2)
usb off
wait 1500
usb on
include home_mac.cpas
wait 6000
pull
press opt+m
press ,
shot home  the home Mac took them: kept again, the batch now goes to its ·XXXX
